{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-13_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-13","title":"在尘或血中","storyCode":"15-14","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-13_beg.txt","sourceHash":"e6fd15ee4d05e0cebb46fa0b9c9d45c66e579dc006c2e49ac9fb5279251f0ab6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"},{"type":"narration","text":"已选择“怀旧金曲”......\n恢复上次播放进度——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——我的爱~♪\n吹散了山丘前的樱花——♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Friston-3，现在不是唱歌的时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我想吗？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"我的播放组件是被自定义的，遥控器又不在我手上——\n该死的可露希尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌，注意正义骑士号！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔到底把我的代码同步功能放在哪个子菜单里了？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"——把女孩子最珍重的眼泪献给你~♪\n请替我保留——♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小猫，我的背后，正义骑士号瞄准我了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挡住了，唔，差点伤到正义骑士号——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好痛，不许再撞我了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异常的THRM-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"（炙热地撞撞)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异常的THRM-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"炽，炽热——Boom......mmmmmmmmm——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——不管是谁~♪\n充满爱意的窃窃私语都是一生一次的陷阱——♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那我们就比比谁的燃烧更火热一些，THRM-EX！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......不要真伤害到小车们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然有数！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异常的Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保、保护伙伙伙伴——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异常的Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要治疗，Friston-3。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，这时候还是得感谢可露希尔为我装配了能量防护发生器——"},{"type":"narration","text":"——呀，我最爱的人就在这里~♪\n你在我的眼泪中闪耀着光芒——♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Friston-3，还需要多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同步模块准备好了，但是这些源石我跳不过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我替你搭路，就是现在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Friston-3加速冲上了跨越障碍的高坡，飞跃到了空中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在空中旋转的时候，他情不自禁地抛下了一张照片。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈，真是好久......没有这样活动了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你大肆夸耀的同频传输系统最好有效，可露希尔......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位，把这几辆昏了头的车引到特定的轨道上来，然后控制住他们，我会让他们恢复正常！"},{"type":"narration","text":"——献给你~♪\n这份我一直深藏在心中的爱——♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连上了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"空旷的沙漠中依旧隐隐回荡着刚刚的歌声。\n——献给你~♪\n这份我一直深藏在心中的爱——♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"毫无疑问，播放组件故障了，可露希尔最爱的煽情音乐开始一遍又一遍地播放，好像这是一个多么催人泪下的场合。\n而他要在此时，向几辆连自主意识都没有的智能小车，分享那场注定离别的梦境，分享自己作为人的，最深藏的回忆。\n特雷弗·弗里斯顿有点想要破口大骂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......这里是什么地方——刚刚我们好像被关在一个、关在一个......呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会什么都记不起来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正义骑士号”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“滴滴”，发现异常目标！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正义骑士号”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"逼自己好好想想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔可是说过你们一个个都聪明得不行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个语气......你、你是Friston-3！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是Friston-3可没有你这么高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"THRM-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他就是Friston-3！我能从他身上感受到熟悉的温度——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"THRM-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"温度......我怎么没法感受自己的温度了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，头疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样或许你们能够更好受些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的梦，一个对我来说同样是惊喜的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安静点听我说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS出了点问题，我大概能猜到发生了什么。你们的认知模块受到了扭曲，到处大搞破坏，我只能出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“正义骑士号”","speakerId":"avg_4000_jnight_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听不懂，“滴滴”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简单来说，我正用自己的核心代码覆写你们的底层代码。当然，我会保证你们的记忆模块完全照旧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这会花上点时间，为了让你们在这期间能够安分一会儿，我不得不把你们的思维模组暂时与我的相连接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"副作用就是......*未知语言粗口*，我会情不自禁地分享我的梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"到底发生了什么，Friston-3？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一位故人快从长眠中苏醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"THRM-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别想了，不然你们的脑子又要过载。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们现在要做的，就是在结束之前，陪我走走。聚会快开始了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert03_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"金发的女孩在张灯结彩的营地中欢快地舞蹈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"THRM-EX","speakerId":"char_376_therex","isRemote":false,"text":"是派对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......是婚礼。我女儿的婚礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不过去吗，Friston-3？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在这里看看就好，我不想过去。过去就意味着我会再一次——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"你在悲伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你能感觉到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，当然。我们不是一样的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Castle-3","speakerId":"avg_286_cast3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说有人扭曲了我们的认知模块，那为什么你要帮助我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪儿有那么多原因。刚才Lancet-2不是说了，我们是一样的......起码现在，起码在罗德岛上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这艘船上的生活很平静，我谈不上喜欢，但比起那个永远没有结果的梦，那些夭折的未来，它没那么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没那么坏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"特雷弗·弗里斯顿听到了女儿熟悉的笑声。\n一场他注定会错过的婚礼，一个他不得不爽约的邀请。只要他不再靠近，她或许就永远不会从他的眼前走开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......代码覆写完成。各位，该回家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他一刻也不愿意停留。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Lancet-2","speakerId":"char_285_medic2","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......怎么变成了这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，Friston-3，他们都已经恢复了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覆写了目前他们所有代码中与PRTS相关的部分，用我的核心代码来保证他们的基本运作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，小猫，这下我们可以放心去支援Misery他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Friston-3，接下来你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和这几位刚刚清醒过来的家伙商量一下，我想我们多少还能帮上点忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Friston-3","speakerId":"avg_4093_frston_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔那边我会沟通。我还准备找她算账呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g10_rhodescorridor_origin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，似乎小车们的状态已经暂时恢复正常了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗里斯顿先生的状态如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，除了有点生我的气，其他都还挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，多亏他想到能借助他的核心代码直接覆写与PRTS相关的底层代码，否则还真挺棘手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可露希尔小姐，如今我们拥有的PRTS权限已经全部失效？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"PRTS主动屏蔽了我们所有人对其的访问，如今它的所有运行都在黑箱中完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然凯尔希在试图争夺其控制权，但我担心她也没法坚持太久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"强制切断PRTS的核心能源。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"强制切断核心能源意味着我们必须直接进入Abyss内部，这一计划的风险很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我会保护博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我们并非孤身作战，精英干员们都站在我们的身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会放弃博士，也不会放弃罗德岛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"强制启动备用系统争夺本舰控制权。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的ZOOT系统并不能完全做到与PRTS争夺控制权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我与凯尔希进行过此种情况的演算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若是借助本舰的能源动力强行启动，短时间内或许它能够拿回某些非核心区域的控制权......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但每次的结果都是过载启动后它的核心元件直接损毁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐，你早就有判断了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我可以直接开干。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能造出一个，就一定能造出第二个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"做两手准备吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"突入Abyss的同时启用备用指挥系统。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesengineeringroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，你终于要上线了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也已经等了太久。现在，让我好好看看你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希尔紧张地等待着，她一直渴望着有朝一日能真正看到它开始运作，但也害怕看到它投入使用的那一天。\n那意味着罗德岛再次面临了束手无策的局面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......启动过载。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，坚持住，“零号油罐”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，拼了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，PRTS正在疯狂攻击我们，ZOOT会协同凯尔希展开防御。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来就交给你们了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g8_rhodeslowerdeck_origin"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所有人测试通讯设备。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已就位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mantra","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在前线等你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前往集合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mechanist","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"马上到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_017_huang_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久没一起干架了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Sharp","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“坏家伙”号已返回本舰，马上集合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Stormeye","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"稍等片刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Pith","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正在集合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"各位，目标已同步。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"优先目标——支援凯尔希。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"核心任务——进入Abyss，切断PRTS的核心能源。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g4_rhodesabyss_w"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_285_medic2","aliases":["Lancet-2","异常的Lancet-2"]},{"speakerId":"char_376_therex","aliases":["THRM-EX","异常的THRM-EX"]}]}
